---
/*
  GoldGround — the gold ground of the icon, around the one movement of
  onderwerpen-en-themas that is about it: "Toen alleen het goddelijke mocht"
  (#133), from its h2 to just before the next h2. The Pantocrator of Sinai
  stands on gold, and for a thousand years only the divine was allowed a
  painting; onderwerpen-en-themas.css draws a narrow vertical band in old gold
  beside the column, over the height of this movement.

  A plain wrapper, like Half in art-nouveau-en-deco: no props, no script. The
  h2 sits inside it, so print.css's `.theme-body h2:first-of-type` would match
  it and drop its page break; the stylesheet restores the break (issue #154).
*/
---
<div class="gold-ground">
  <slot />
</div>
